title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1): a 3 s take played back: VOLUME 100 % in the SOFT slot (the scripted output has no volume control: Cassette's software volume), - steps it to 97 %, STOP brings CARD and SOFT back unchanged
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
expect text "CARD"
expect text "SOFT"
tap "REC"
wait 3300
tap "STOP"
wait 1000
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "VOLUME"
key space
wait 800
expect text "VOLUME"
expect text "100 %"
expect notext "CARD"
shot bound-volume
type -
wait 500
expect text "97 %"
say - set the software volume one level down
key x
wait 800
expect text "CARD"
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "VOLUME"
shot bound-stopped
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
